Source: vajra-keyring
Section: misc
Priority: important
Maintainer: Vajra OS Team <packages@vajra-os.org>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.5.0
Homepage: https://vajra-os.org

Package: vajra-keyring
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, gnupg
Description: Vajra OS repository signing key
 Contains the GPG public key used to sign the Vajra OS APT repository.
 Users install this package to verify the authenticity of Vajra OS packages.
 .
 The key is installed to /usr/share/keyrings/vajra-archive-keyring.gpg and
 automatically configures apt to use it for repository verification.
